       }
      ],
      "text": "Role in ASD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " atypical antipsych (eg, risperidone, aripiprazole) help ritualistic, self-injurious and aggressive behaviors."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Risperidone: irritability w autistic dx (aggression, self-injury, tantrums, quickly changing moods); efficacy in 3 short-term trials, ages 5–17."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Aripiprazole for irritability w autistic dx (6–17 y): start 2 mg/day; usual 5–15 mg/day."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Risperidone cautions:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " in kids, assess wt gain against expected norm growth; raises PRL more than other antipsych; galactorrhea, amenorrhea, gynecomastia and impotence are reported w prolactin-elevating drugs."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
